@Booking_HostAddress = https://localhost:7109
### Pegar acá el access_token que devuelve la prueba 1 de AuthServer.http (dura 30 minutos)
@token = PEGAR_TOKEN_ACA

### 1) Sin token -> 401
GET {{Booking_HostAddress}}/Booking/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6

### 2) Con token -> 200
GET {{Booking_HostAddress}}/Booking/3fa85f64-5717-4562-b3fc-2c963f66afa6
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
